<title>THAILAND: PTT Exploration Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>PTT Exploration Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.92     vs	     0.78</p>
<p>    Net			284.69     vs	   242.68</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.71     vs	     2.35</p>
<p>    Net			840.56     vs	   728.71</p>
<p>NOTE: PTT Exploration and Production Plc is oil and natural gas exploration company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
